[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4381691233","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119221#issuecomment-4381691233","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119221","id":4381691233,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBStNYQ","user":{"login":"Bromeon","id":708488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/708488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Bromeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T17:50:18Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T17:50:18Z","body":"Worth noting that `@rpc` and `Node::rpc_config` seem to operate in two separate address spaces. The latter has the 15th bit `0x8000` set for RPC IDs. This means that GDExtension and GDScript cannot share RPCs among each other.\r\n\r\nSee also https://github.com/godot-rust/gdext/issues/1533#issuecomment-4189543952. I can make a proper issue about this, but thought this behavior might be worth mentioning if we're already clarifying the docs.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4381691233/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4405708455","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119221#issuecomment-4405708455","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119221","id":4405708455,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBpnGpw","user":{"login":"haider0072","id":55896536,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1ODk2NTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55896536?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072","html_url":"https://github.com/haider0072","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-08T10:30:40Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T10:30:40Z","body":"Good catch, didn't realize @rpc and rpc_config sit in different ID spaces with that 0x8000 flag. That's a separate behavior from what this PR documents (script-vs-node precedence when the same method has both), so I'd rather keep this PR scoped to the precedence note and let the GDScript/GDExtension cross-language RPC story land in its own issue + doc pass. A proper issue would be great. Happy to follow up on the docs once the behavior is locked in (intended limitation, or something to fix).","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4405708455/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4415880753","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119221#issuecomment-4415880753","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119221","id":4415880753,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBzT-MQ","user":{"login":"haider0072","id":55896536,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1ODk2NTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55896536?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072","html_url":"https://github.com/haider0072","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-10T17:20:29Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T17:20:29Z","body":"Applied the suggestion, thanks. Changed 'takes precedence' to 'takes priority'.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4415880753/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4418654775","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119221#i